      "Modifier": {
        "description": "An additive surcharge on a line (carpet thick/shaggy).\n\nARCHITECTURE §6 describes modifiers as multiplicative — \"strategy result x\n(1 + modifiers)\" — but its own §5 data says `add_range: [300, 500]` and\nPRICES.md §F says \"+ KSh 300 - 500\". Additive wins: the source of truth and\nthe concrete data agree against one line of loose prose. The two happen to\ncoincide on a 5x7 carpet (1000 + 300 == 1000 * 1.3), which is exactly how\nthis would ship unnoticed, so the test asserts on a 6x9 instead.",
        "properties": {
          "add": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Add"
          },
          "add_range": {
            "anyOf": [
